========================================================================================================================
Overcrowding sim v0.1 | seed base 20261127 | 500 seeds per row | 20 years (y5/y10/y15/y20 = same runs)
Player cells: median/p10-p90 pride size (cubs count unless marked). reg10/20 = median regions held. over = % of seasons
over capacity. 1stOver / 1stWarn = median year of the first overcrowded season / first warning sign (among runs
where it happens). warn<=y10 / dep<=y10 = runs with a warning sign / a departure by year 10. dep/20y = mean cats
leaving under loners §6.4 in 20 years. wave = runs where >=1/3 of adults (and >=3 cats) leave within 4 seasons.
<half-cap y20 = runs ending below half of capacity (collapse proxy). Standard, accumulator reading, p_out .5 (C2).
